/**
 * One tag's full review-retention breakdown, worst-first ΓÇö the un-truncated
 * sibling of {@link FlashcardWeakReviewTagData} (thß║ºy 2026-07-17 stats-insight
 * redesign: "bß╗Å LIMIT 1" so the whole per-tag ranking is visible, not just the
